Dear Fellow Primates,

We have proudly present you, once again, with a fresh patch that brings more content to Dunjungle!

[h3]New Boss - Sapella Queen the Third[/h3]
[list]
[*] A WAXY and TACKY Queen made of sap?? 
[/list]
[h3]New Skill - ???[/h3]
[list]
[*] Not breaking it to you folks this time - find the Queen and defeat her to obtain this funky new trick!
[/list]
[h3]Tweaks:[/h3]
[list]
[*] Keyboard Bindings: Now you can bind actions to W/A/S/D and they will override the Jump and Movement actions. Allowing you to move with the Arrow Keys + execute other actions with WASD.
[*] Added a confirmation prompt to the "Restart Run" button;
[*] Added a message indicating that progress will be saved from the last door if you exit the game via the "Exit Game" button;
[*] Endless mode will now be unlocked after beating Hard Difficulty;
[*] Extra Hard mode enemy bonus stats will be slightly nerfed, but you may encounter more elite enemies that drop Power Ups, allowing for a stronger build;
[*] Baby Monkeys will drop a Reward every time another Baby Monkey is rescued;
[*] Disabled Screen Shake effect when your Summons die
[*] Relic: Greedy Gloves - Changed to +1% damage every 25 gold;
[*] Skill: Explosive Fruit - Increased Base Damage;
[*] Skill: Homing Orb - Increased Base Damage;
[*] Enemy: Octomage - Slighly decreased HP;
[/list]

That's about it! We are still hard at cooking for more out-of-the-world content updates. Thank you for your attention and support!

Stay tuned!

The Dunjungle Team

Oct.24, 2024

Fellow Primates,

Thanks a lot for your timely feedback across different channels; we have taken action to address some of your concerns and suggestions! 

Please find the following updates to Dunjungle in this patch, mainly focused on balance adjustments!


[list]
[*] Added a few immunity frames after receiving damage (Normal Difficulty Only);
[*] Reduced overall damage of enemies in the first biome;
[*] Reduced frequency of mushroom poison spores damage output from every 0.2 to every 0.5 seconds;
[*] Reduced frequency of salamander fire damage output from every 0.2 to every 0.5 seconds;
[*] Increased height of hitbox for horizontally-hitting weapons;
[*] Snake venom - effect "movement confusion" removed from Normal Difficulty;
[*] Snake venom - enemy kill requirement reduced in lower difficulty (Normal: 10, Hard: 15, ExtraHard: 20);
[*] Buffed Relic "Truce Treaty"'s bonus immunity time period (20 frames -> 40 frames);
[*] Buffed Relic "Pet Collar“‘'s Summon Lifetime (50% -> 100%);
[*] Bug fixes: A bug preventing Summons from disappearing after certain time;
[*] Bug fixes: A bug preventing Interacting with some NPCs when mapping B (or Circle/A) button to the Interact Action.
[/list]

We'll continue to do our best to polish Dunjungle in order to present it to you in its best form in the future full release. Thanks again for your continued support!

The Dunjungle Team
